缘传送至另一侧边缘。<br /><br />任何尝试进入或离开该区域的敌人都会被施加持续1.5/1.75/2秒的50%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<br /><br />阿萝拉可以<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>这个技能来提前结束区域效果。","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[100,100,100],"costBurn":"100/100/100","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[250,250,250],"rangeBurn":"250/250/250","image":{"full":"AuroraR.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"冷却时间","values":"140/120/100"},{"label":"伤害","values":"175/275/375"},{"label":"持续时间","values":"3/3.5/4"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"R Scaling","labelKo":"R 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"3:DamageCalc"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"DamageCalc","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[175,275,375],"terms":[{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[0.699999988079071,0.699999988079071,0.699999988079071]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/a8d03f6b0dcad6a24201faf2273f82bf.webp","spellId":"AuroraR"}]}},"Elise":{"P:蜘蛛女皇":{"slot":"P","passive":{"name":"蜘蛛女皇","description":"伊莉丝在游戏开始时自带1级终极技能，使她可以在<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">人类形态</span>和<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">蜘蛛形态</span>之间变形。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">人类形态：</span>伊莉丝的技能在命中时会为她提供一只休眠中的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">小蜘蛛</span>，至多至2/3/4/5只。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">蜘蛛形态：</span>攻击造成额外的<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(14/24/34/44 + ([[si:scaleap]]15% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>、并回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(6/8/10/12 + ([[si:scaleap]]8% 法术强度))生命值</span>。","summary":"人类形态：每当伊莉丝的技能命中一名敌人时，就会有一只小蜘蛛准备就绪。<br><br>蜘蛛形态：普攻造成额外魔法伤害并回复自身生命值。","spellId":"ElisePassive","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","rankValues":[],"sca